;; db: bench_accel_broom -- single-source reach over the broom graph (fat
;; ER core + long thin chains hanging off it).  NOTE 2026-09-06: this file
;; had been byte-identical to accel_reach_braid.slog INCLUDING its db
;; header, so every "broom" measurement before this date actually re-ran
;; braid; data/bench_accel_broom existed unused.  The rule body is the
;; same generic reach on purpose -- only the graph shape differs.
table (edge int int)
table (src int)
table (reach int)

rule (src X) --> (reach X)
rule (reach X) (edge X Y) --> (reach Y)
